      "displayName": "Danny Bernstein",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>To test:  </p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>start repo : java -Dfcrepo.dynamic.jms.port=61717 -Dfcrepo.dynamic.stomp.port=61713 -jar fcrepo-webapp-4.8.0-SNAPSHOT-jetty-console-a07a1a46.jar --port 8686 --headless --contextPath /f4</li>\n\t<li>Add an external object:  curl -X PUT -H\"Content-Type: message/external-body; access-type=URL; URL=\\\"https://static01.nyt.com/images/2017/06/11/us/11West-Obit/11West-Obit-master768.jpg\\\"\" \"http://localhost:8686/f4/rest/batman\"</li>\n\t<li>export java -jar fcrepo-import-export-0.1.1-SNAPSHOT.jar -d export -a -m export -r <a href=\"http://localhost:8686/f4/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8686/f4/rest</a> -b --writeConfig export-config.yml -x</li>\n\t<li>verify: fcrepo-verify /Users/danny/code/fcrepo-import-export/target/export-config.yml </li>\n</ol>\n",
     "created": "13/Jun/17 10:32 AM",
